(vi)
The grounds of commitment, if any;
(vii)
Documentary evidence, if any;
(viii)
Police challan, if any.

29. The paper-book shall contain the following papers: -
(a)
Police challan;
(b)
First information Report, if any;
(c)
Magistrate's charge with list of witnesses, if any;
(d)
Statement under Section 164, if any;
(e)
Examination under Section 281 and 131, if any;
(f)
Grounds of commitment, if any;
(g)
Record of evidence in the Court of Sessions with any further examination under Section 281 and altered charge, if any;
(h)
Judgment of the Sessions Court;
(i)
Material documentary evidence, if any;
